}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Describes events that happened at work, using appropriate expressions and well-constructed simple past phrases."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le07ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking to the Boss"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to ask about feedback at work, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ... ?</span> </br> You use the Simple Present tense to respond to feedback or give thanks. </br></br>Here are some useful expressions you can use when you ask for feedback from your boss.<br /><br />Be sure to thank your boss for the feedback."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Feedback</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Thanking for Feedback</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you want to review my project?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thank you for your feedback. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I finished the assignment.  Would you like to review it?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I appreciate your understanding. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you have any comments on my performance?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That is very useful for me. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where do you think I need to improve?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will remember that next time.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to finish "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to complete "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter, did you finish the report?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk to your boss."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "assignment "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a written task for work or school "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I completed the assignment. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to discuss "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to talk about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Let's discuss the issue now."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to improve "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something better "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could you share your ideas on how to improve the program?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to run out of "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not have enough of something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My printer ran out of paper."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "improvement "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making something better "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I asked Peter to suggest improvements to the internship program."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "began "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "past tense of verb to begin "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I only began this job yesterday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "report "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a document "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I asked Peter to prepare a report on his new responsibilities."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "internship "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "work experience related to studies, for little or no payment "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you suggest any improvements to the internship program?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob03aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 - 8 things to say in a meeting. Write each sentence on a separate piece of paper. Use the past tense. (Example: <span class=\"italic\">I didn't complete the assignment.</span>)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner is the boss. Read the sentence and explain the situation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your boss gives you feedback."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Thank your boss for the feedback."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify situations for a meeting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for and give feedback."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Mr. Lockerty</span>: We are at the final point on the agenda: intern report.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: I asked Peter to prepare a report about his new responsibilities, and to suggest improvements to the internship program. Peter, did you finish the report?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn3le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ummm ... Yes, Mr. Warren, I completed the assignment, but ...<br /><span class =\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>:  But?<br /><span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: My printer ran out of paper. I didn't print the whole report.<br /><span class =\"strong\">Ms. Truman</span>:  Oh dear.<br /><span class =\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>:  Well then, let's discuss it now. Could you share your ideas on how to improve the program, Peter?<br /><span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I only began yesterday ...", "id": 2, "time": "18000", "image": "engenn3le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Ms. Truman</span>: You started three days ago, Peter.<br /><span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Yes, but it took me two days before I understood my new responsibilities.<br /><span class =\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>:  Fine. You can give us your report at the next meeting.<br /><span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Thank you, Mr. Warren. I appreciate your understanding.<br />", "id": 3, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn3le07ob03re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_